              <div class="bd-foot"><span class="bd-auto">Auto ▾</span><span class="bd-right"><span class="bd-mic">🎙</span><span class="bd-send">↑</span></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="bd-h2">Option E — Ridgelines</h2>
          <p class="bd-sub">Stacked pulse lines, Joy-Division-style, fading toward the top. Signal-over-noise energy; flat where the composer sits.</p>
          <div class="bd-scene">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 800 320" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
